[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) holds every report about a booking on the wrong day, merged as one issue and
marked known. Read the reports and they split three ways: two different ways a month gets flipped, and a
day that moves by one. Each problem now has its own ticket. The counts below are built from the ticket
export at render time.

